	(text_box "This exists mainly to slow the turn on and limit inrush.\n\nSR (V/ms) = I_{inrush (mA)}/C_{out(uF)}\nC_{dVdt (pF)} = 4600 / SR(V/ms)\nP_{D (inrush)} = 0.5 * Vin * Iinrush -> must be <3W\nSR = 0.26 V/ms\n\n5V:\nRamp up time to 5V = 5/0.26 = 19ms turn on time\n\n15V:\nRamp up time to 15V = 15/0.26 = 58ms turn on time\n\n24V:\nRamp up time to 24V = 24/0.26 = 92ms turn on time\n\n\nIf we use the 5V bus capactiance (largest bus) of 2700uF, we find inrush using:\nI_{inrush} = C_{load} * dV/dt = 2700 * dV/dt\n\nSo for all busses we have an inrush of 702mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 661.416 133.35 0)
		(size 49.53 49.53)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "174933a7-0a9e-48f2-b631-3bf4a54b06a2")
	)
	(text_box "Taken from table in datasheet, 9.3ms retry delay."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 523.494 82.55 0)
		(size 43.18 8.89)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c8d0fdd-9690-4c51-9bb6-151cd027db55")
	)
	(text_box "I_{load(A)} = V_{imon(uV)} / (R_{imon(R)} * G_{imon(uA/A)})\nFor V_{in}>5V -> Recommended max V_{imon}=3.3v\nG_{imon} = 243 uA/A typ.\n\nAssuming worst case load of 10A:\nR_{imon(R)} = 1358R -> 1k33 OK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 556.006 132.2618 0)
		(size 45.974 33.3462)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8fbefe34-400e-468e-8c07-2a70537d58ac")
	)
	(text_box "Rillim puts a constant current protection but only triggered if overcurent < fast-trip current (I_{FT}). I_{FT} = 210% I_{illim} so immediate response in case of short in cables. Else we don't care.\n\nR_{illim} = 1460 / (I_{LIM(A)} - 0.11)\n10A -> 147.6R = 147R (10.04A)\n\nRillim = 121R = 12A for 5V, 15V = \nRillim = 182R = 8A for 24V = \n\n\nFor 5 and 15V:\nIlim min = 8.5A\nIlim max = 11A\n\nFor 24V:\nIlim min = 7.1A\nIlim max = 8.96A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 482.854 130.556 0)
		(size 65.024 40.9662)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "acdc1373-fbd3-478f-9813-9f50e4a98e9b")
	)
	(text_box "Infinite auto-retry \nnrtry short to gnd"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 512.826 113.284 0)
		(size 17.78 7.62)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8864774-0e9d-44a0-a2e1-3bf8b1041abf")
	)
	(text_box "This allows the chip to survive an overcurrent fault for Xms before going into fault.\n\nt_{itimer(ms)} = (C_{itimer(nF)} * deltaV_{itimer(V)}) / I_{itimer (uA)}\ndeltaV_timer = 0.98V\nitimer = 2.1uA\n--> t_{itimer} = 0.4667*C_{itimer(nF)}\n\ntITIMER = 5 ms -> allows moderate transient overcurrent pulses without tripping the current limiter\n\n--> Citimer = 5*2.1/0.98 = 10.7nF = 10nF COG \n\nBig t_{itimer} capacitors can cause boot issues so have to follow:\nC_{itimer} < t_{ghi} / 53000\nt_{ghi} = t_{d,on} + C_{dVdT}*(V_in + 3.6) / I_{dVdT} = time to reach steady state\nC_{dvdt} = 18nF, I_{dVdt} = 4.76uA typ.\n\nFor 5V with 19ms startup time:\nt_{ghi} = 51ms -> C_{itimer} < 962nF\n\nFor 15V with 58ms startup time:\nt_{ghi} = 128.3ms -> C_{itimer} < 2420nF\n\nFor 24V with 92ms startup time:\nt_{ghi} = 196ms -> C_{itimer} < 3700nF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 408.686 133.604 0)
		(size 52.324 60.1686)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f8a84d52-e39f-4690-884a-284be6aa4ee1")
	)
